vLLM PR #51812 (merged 2026-08-11, released in v0.28.0): align the Qwen GDN
gate tensors with the gathered speculative tokens.

In a mixed batch under speculative decoding, _forward_core gathers mixed_qkv
with spec_token_indx but passed the ungathered a/b gate tensors to
fused_sigmoid_gating_delta_rule_update. The kernel consumes the first T_spec
gate rows, so whenever a non-speculative token sorts before the speculative
ones the gates belong to different tokens than the Q/K/V rows. Gather a and b
with the same indices; the pure-spec fast path (num_prefills == 0 and
num_decodes == 0, where spec_token_indx is an arange and the gather is the
identity) keeps its unsorted tensors.

Reachable here on SPEC=mtp, which runs the V1 model runner: the GDN metadata
builder sorts non-spec tokens first, so any step that mixes an MTP decode with
a prefill chunk or a non-speculative decode pairs the wrong gates. The V2
runner (SPEC=dflash2) ordered spec tokens first and was already unaffected.
Upstream measured mean chosen-logprob error 0.002755 -> 0.000208 on
Qwen3.5-2B; greedy ids were unchanged there, sampling is affected.

Apply from the installed vllm package directory:
  patch -p1 -d venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/vllm < patches/vllm-pr51812-gdn-spec-gates.patch

Written against vLLM 0.27.1.

Source: https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/51812 (Apache-2.0).

--- a/model_executor/layers/mamba/gdn/qwen_gdn_linear_attn.py
+++ b/model_executor/layers/mamba/gdn/qwen_gdn_linear_attn.py
@@ -1249,9 +1249,13 @@
         if spec_sequence_masks is not None:
             if attn_metadata.num_prefills == 0 and attn_metadata.num_decodes == 0:
                 mixed_qkv_spec = mixed_qkv
+                a_spec = a
+                b_spec = b
                 mixed_qkv_non_spec = None
             else:
                 mixed_qkv_spec = mixed_qkv.index_select(0, spec_token_indx)
+                a_spec = a.index_select(0, spec_token_indx)
+                b_spec = b.index_select(0, spec_token_indx)
                 mixed_qkv_non_spec = mixed_qkv.index_select(0, non_spec_token_indx)
         else:
             mixed_qkv_spec = None
@@ -1376,8 +1380,8 @@
             core_attn_out_spec, last_recurrent_state = (
                 fused_sigmoid_gating_delta_rule_update(
                     A_log=self.A_log,
-                    a=a,
-                    b=b,
+                    a=a_spec,
+                    b=b_spec,
                     dt_bias=self.dt_bias,
                     q=query_spec,
                     k=key_spec,
